a6a0340bc29aa8d","layer":"original","quote":"李傕、郭汜入长安，欲连表为援；乃以表为镇南将军、荆州牧，封成武侯，假节。天子都许，表虽遣使贡献，然北与袁绍相结；治中邓羲谏表，表不听。﹝三﹞羲辞疾而退，终表之世。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":451,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o090","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-35b4f4f1203d0e78df18","layer":"original","quote":"太祖以琮为青州刺史，封列侯；﹝一﹞蒯越等，侯者十五人。越，为光禄勋；﹝二﹞嵩，大鸿胪〖1〗；﹝三﹞羲，侍中；﹝四﹞先，尚书令；其余多至大官。﹝五﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":499,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p111","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-a7265c6082f82259dd96","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“表答羲曰：‘内不失贡职，外不背盟主；此天下之达义也。治中独何怪乎？’”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":470,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f0f4ee865a903de408c5","start":0,"end":47},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p123","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-84158a5c524180916153","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞羲，章陵人。","attribution":"裴注释籍贯","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":507,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-11379688f88b564e3dc8","start":0,"end":9}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
